[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4086899043","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117599#issuecomment-4086899043","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117599","id":4086899043,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7zmSFj","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-19T01:30:10Z","updated_at":"2026-03-19T01:45:42Z","body":"In the current state, I measured a 8KiB decrease in Linux binary size (`target=template_release production=yes`), but also a 4% FPS loss in Bunnymark (500 bunnies, from 3 tests).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4086899043/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4090127953","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117599#issuecomment-4090127953","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117599","id":4090127953,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7zymZR","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-19T13:27:14Z","updated_at":"2026-03-19T13:44:47Z","body":"Tested on a custom Bunnymark ([here for anyone who'd like to test too](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26115491/bunnymark-custom.zip)) that runs for about 30 seconds and returns the average FPS for the last 15 seconds.\r\n\r\nApart from running it a total seven parallel times, I also added a special case where `method_map` remains a `HashMap` (PR converts it to `AHashMap` while moving it to `GDType`). All builds are `target=template_release production=yes`. I also made sure to close as many apps as possible and use [Feral's gamemode](https://github.com/FeralInteractive/gamemode) to ensure all cases run on equal circumstances:\r\n\r\n| Build | Run 1 | Run 2 | Run 3 | Run 4 | Run 5 | Run 6 | Run 7 |\r\n|-|-|-|-|-|-|-|-|\r\n|`master`| 2653 | 2638 | 2652 | 2646 | 2641 | 2636 | 2654 |\r\n| PR | 2515 | 2523 | 2494 | 2476 | 2489 | 2474 | 2523 |\r\n| PR (`HashMap`) | 2660 | 2650 | 2651 | 2598 | 2667 | 2622 | 2601 |\r\n\r\nIn all comparisons between using an `AHashMap` with `HashMap`, all lowest `HashMap` cases beat the highest `AHashMap` ones.\r\n\r\nI hope these results end [any doubts about fluctuation](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117599#discussion_r2958680829).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4090127953/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4090380485","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117599#issuecomment-4090380485","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117599","id":4090380485,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7zzkDF","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-19T14:04:42Z","updated_at":"2026-03-19T14:04:42Z","body":"Thank you for testing again, but average fps of 2600 is not meaningful. It is not a realistic load on the engine, and again, I doubt that the method binds are the bottleneck in the setup. I'm not sure what you're measuring, but we've had this discussion before.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4090380485/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4090703156","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117599#issuecomment-4090703156","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117599","id":4090703156,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7z0y00","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-19T14:52:29Z","updated_at":"2026-03-19T14:53:19Z","body":"> I doubt that the method binds are the bottleneck in the setup.\r\n\r\nWell, a lower FPS in seven runs specifically when `method_map` is an `AHashMap` instead of `HashMap` can be anything but a coincidence.\r\n\r\nThe data is there, and data shows that using `AHashMap` does, in fact, slightly affect performance negatively. Little to no fluctuations.\r\n\r\nAnd to reinforce that the change does, in fact, have an impact: Profiling the very same Bunnymark shows high CPU cycle usage in `HashMap` lookups within `ClassDB::get_property()`, and that includes `method_map` lookups.\r\n\r\nIf this is intended as a `performance` PR (it has the label), I think notable performance improvements are expected, but so far the only test someone dared to do showed a performance regression.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4090703156/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4090852076","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117599#issuecomment-4090852076","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117599","id":4090852076,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7z1XLs","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-19T15:14:36Z","updated_at":"2026-03-19T15:30:51Z","body":"> but average fps of 2600 is not meaningful. It is not a realistic load on the engine\r\n\r\nModified the test to spawn 5000 bunnies instead of 500, which I guess counts as a realistic load. Less tests as fluctuation tends to be lower in these cases. Results (FPS, higher is better):\r\n\r\n| Build | Run 1 | Run 2 | Run 3 | Run 4 |\r\n|-|-|-|-|-|\r\n|`master`| 380 | 369 | 377 | 383 |\r\n| PR | 358 | 358 | 354 | 355 |\r\n| PR (`HashMap`) | 378 | 376 | 381 | 387 |\r\n\r\nSame \"worst result before beats the best result after\" applies.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4090852076/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4090942725","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117599#issuecomment-4090942725","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117599","id":4090942725,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7z1tUF","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-19T15:25:50Z","updated_at":"2026-03-19T15:50:52Z","body":"> Modified the test to spawn 5000 bunnies instead of 500\r\n\r\nI don't like to do this as it's an unlikely use case, but here is with 50000 bunnies (FPS, higher is better):\r\n| Build | Run 1 | Run 2 | Run 3 |\r\n|-|-|-|-|\r\n|`master`| 34.06 | 33.6 | 34.33 |\r\n| PR | 32 | 32.33 | 31.33 |\r\n| PR (`HashMap`) | 35.87 | 35.40 | 34.73 |\r\n\r\nNow you have even more data. Do what you want with it except claim the PR improves performance in the current state with that label.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4090942725/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4188855905","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117599#issuecomment-4188855905","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117599","id":4188855905,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75rN5h","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-05T12:59:39Z","updated_at":"2026-04-05T12:59:52Z","body":"Looks like tests succeed now, so hopefully it's ready for mergability evaluation.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4188855905/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4228007484","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117599#issuecomment-4228007484","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117599","id":4228007484,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78AkY8","user":{"login":"SWKrefs","id":264601255,"node_id":"U_kgDOD8V-pw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/264601255?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SWKrefs","html_url":"https://github.com/SWKrefs","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SWKrefs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SWKrefs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SWKrefs/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SWKrefs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SWKrefs/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SWKrefs/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SWKrefs/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SWKrefs/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SWKrefs/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-11T03:01:32Z","updated_at":"2026-04-11T03:01:32Z","body":"What is the reason for using AHashMap if it measurably decreases performance?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4228007484/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4228147461","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117599#issuecomment-4228147461","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117599","id":4228147461,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78BGkF","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-11T04:09:02Z","updated_at":"2026-04-12T19:05:02Z","body":"> What is the reason for using AHashMap if it measurably decreases performance?\r\n\r\nIt's a multi-step change. Stuff is being moved from `ClassDB` to `GDType`, and some temporary regressions are expected here and there. [I even reported a tiny regression in one of the first moves](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113586#issuecomment-4008803252).\r\n\r\nEven with the change to `AHashMap`, dozens of super-type lookup loops (which are the biggest overhead of ClassDB) will eventually cease looping, which in this PR's case happened with `ClassDB::get_method()`. *Especially* in `ClassDB::get_property()`, which is the biggest impact from my measurements. \r\n\r\nThe same test over [an unpolished attempt of mine to predict the final code result](https://github.com/DeeJayLSP/godot/commit/7cb35f2f14c585c11d5c01b8d575112954643f4c) showed a *massive* boost (around 15%) even when compared to 4.6 stable. If anything, I chose to trust that there won't be performance regressions once all moves are done and adjusted. If changing the `AHashMap` back to `HashMap` proves to improve things even further, it will probably be done.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4228147461/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4887654860","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117599#issuecomment-4887654860","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117599","id":4887654860,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI1OxzA","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-05T21:29:31Z","updated_at":"2026-07-05T22:26:26Z","body":"I think the PR is ready to go now. It succeeds on my own hot reload test at least, which so far was always the hardest challenge.\r\n\r\nEdit: Celebrated too soon; new issues found, now fixed. Should be good now though! _knocks on wood_","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4887654860/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5065833919","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117599#issuecomment-5065833919","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117599","id":5065833919,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLfJ9vw","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/De